{"annotationDigest":"sha256:e72a8e1b9bc4072398f50bee1ab705087f0d7f21ae387ae46b3fb42d29c3b44b","annotationId":"rann-c2638a7829a255772ee910c95a2b644d","author":{"agent":"claude-code","kind":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5.5"},"createdAt":"2026-10-02T01:48:25Z","disclaimer":"AI-generated review opinion derived from the evidence package. It is not a verdict, does not change readiness, and must be confirmed by a human reviewer.","disclosureCheck":{"blocking":5,"contradictions":[],"disclosures":7,"nextDecision":"human_judgement","readiness":"not_assessed"},"findings":[{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"MenuModel.js:377 changes the app bias from -5 to -100. Match tiers run 0-80 (menus/links -2), so apps land at -100..-20 and every menu row at -2..80. The final key is score*1000 + depth*25 + order, so the gap of at least 18,000 points dominates depth and order. SJ7P's description was rewritten on the mirror (proof work, a3c14244/478f9ae7) to state this.","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/MenuModel.js","kind":"file","line":377},{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","kind":"requirement"}],"severity":"info","title":"The ranking change is in searchScore, traced at function level to SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","verification":{"evidence":[{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","kind":"requirement"}],"method":"review.changes (spec, code-trace, function and call-level requirement impact)","note":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P is in review.changes (modified, matchLevel function).","status":"confirmed"}},{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-TKDP"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"Menu.qml:695-713 splits drilldown rows into appRows and deeperRows. It emits apps, then current-menu rows, then deeper rows, and derives searchDivider from the section marks. Menu.qml is a file-level unit (weak_mapping, 28 requirements), so rebuildDisplay has no function-level trace. TKDP's text was rewritten on the mirror to state the new order and divider rule.","refs":[